04:27:38,510 --> 04:27:39,550
Sable is physics engine.

4433
04:27:39,710 --> 04:27:40,470
Oh, okay, well there you go.

4434
04:27:41,010 --> 04:27:44,290
I guess you couldn't have the Simulate or Aeronautics without it done.

4435
04:27:46,770 --> 04:27:48,290
Finally some Metal Gear gameplay.

4436
04:27:48,930 --> 04:27:51,710
That's a stealth series, right?

4437
04:27:52,790 --> 04:27:54,150
I do want to play that game actually.

4438
04:27:55,030 --> 04:27:59,250
It's like a whole series and Kojima made it and I really like Death Stranding, so I think I'll like it.

4439
04:28:00,390 --> 04:28:02,730
And I do in general like sneaking in games.

4440
04:28:03,650 --> 04:28:05,290
I'm pretty bad at it, but it's still fun.

4441
04:28:07,850 --> 04:28:09,190
Can you make a motorbike?

4442
04:28:09,510 --> 04:28:10,070
Maybe!

4443
04:28:11,030 --> 04:28:12,670
Probably, it wouldn't surprise me if you could.

4444
04:28:17,300 --> 04:28:22,160
I mean, you can make airplanes and frickin' air balloons and tanks and cars.

4445
04:28:23,180 --> 04:28:24,380
Wouldn't surprise me at all.

4446
04:28:26,460 --> 04:28:27,900
Will you play the whole series?

4447
04:28:27,900 --> 04:28:30,480
That fully depends on whether or not I'm having fun.

4448
04:28:31,260 --> 04:28:34,700
If I'm hating the first game, I probably won't be playing it after that.

4449
04:28:37,440 --> 04:28:39,360
And of course I'll start with the first game.

4450
04:28:40,080 --> 04:28:41,780
I'm gonna play it in order if I do.

4451
04:28:48,610 --> 04:28:49,370
Vintage Story?

4452
04:28:49,370 --> 04:28:52,150
A lot of people ask me about that game, like they want me to play it.

4453
04:28:53,090 --> 04:28:54,790
As far as I know, it's not finished.

4454
04:28:56,170 --> 04:28:59,470
Like it's still in early development or early access or whatever.

4455
04:29:00,570 --> 04:29:02,190
I will never revisit Terraria.

4456
04:29:06,810 --> 04:29:09,350
Unless they make a Terraria 2 and it's nothing like Terraria.

4457
04:29:09,530 --> 04:29:11,150
And it's more like Detroit become human.

4458
04:29:12,050 --> 04:29:13,750
In that case, I'll play it.

4459
04:29:18,290 --> 04:29:19,430
Okay guys, I'm out of here!

4460
04:29:20,050 --> 04:29:22,150
I'm gonna figure out what to make for dinner, actually.

4461
04:29:22,350 --> 04:29:24,050
I think I'll just go to the store and be inspired.

4462
04:29:25,110 --> 04:29:26,850
I go to the store every day anyway, you know.

4463
04:29:26,950 --> 04:29:28,290
It's good to get a little bit of...

4464
04:29:29,050 --> 04:29:30,850
fresh air and stuff, so...

4465
04:29:30,850 --> 04:29:31,750
Thank you for watching!

4466
04:29:32,030 --> 04:29:35,190
We are getting closer and closer to the day where trains...

4467
04:29:36,070 --> 04:29:36,430
are...

4468
04:29:36,430 --> 04:29:38,770
fully enveloping my Minecraft world.

4469
04:29:38,890 --> 04:29:39,630
And it's gonna be glorious.

4470
04:29:40,610 --> 04:29:41,510
Thank you for watching.

4471
04:29:41,770 --> 04:29:42,830
Have a wonderful Monday.

4472
04:29:43,530 --> 04:29:45,530
And I wish you the best week of all time.

4473
04:29:45,710 --> 04:29:45,950
Bye bye!
